	    0x0C00000  0x200000  c140      0x200000 from files, 0x000000 pad 0x00
	    0x0E00000  0x020000  audiocpu  0x020000 from files, 0x000000 pad 0xFF
	    0x0E20000  0x1E0000  gap_wram  0x000000 from files, 0x1E0000 pad 0x00
	    0x1000000  0x400000  c355spr   0x400000 from files, 0x000000 pad 0x00

	  Total stream = 0x1400000 bytes (20.00 MB).
	  point24 lane 0 is a duplicate of *-h (MRA cannot emit a constant byte lane);
	  MAME has 0x00 there and the core must ignore stream byte 4n (docs/s21_mra.md §4).
